{"unit_id":"tianmingwan__dsh-balanced-search#card-zh","repo":"tianmingwan/dsh-balanced-search","commit":"1f1bcb27fb8154c58f4b3190c00050efa09cb014","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balanced-search 是面向 DSH Web 的网页搜索与抓取插件。它注册 balanced_search 和 balanced_fetch 工具，并将 DSH 内置 web_search、web_fetch 路由到共享的 provider 池。六家服务按轮换顺序提供搜索和内容抓取，失败时切换到其他服务；搜索支持时间范围和结果数量，抓取可设长度上限与实时模式，也可通过 MCP stdio 使用。适合需要在 DSH 中搜索网页、获取页面正文或连接 MCP 客户端的场景。使用前需配置六家服务中至少一个 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:879-950","cordis.patch.yml:1-38"]}
{"unit_id":"tianmingwan__dsh-balanced-search#card-en","repo":"tianmingwan/dsh-balanced-search","commit":"1f1bcb27fb8154c58f4b3190c00050efa09cb014","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-balanced-search adds web search and fetching to DSH. It registers two tools and routes built-in web tools through six rotating providers with failover. Search supports time filters; fetch supports live mode and a character cap. An MCP server is included. Configure one provider API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:879-950","cordis.patch.yml:1-38"]}
